LICENSE / NOTICE — LAFC-Evict tutorial
=======================================

This repository bundles two distinct layers with different rights holders.
Read this notice before reusing any content from this repository.

1. LAFC-Evict dataset (not redistributed in this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------------

The LAFC-Evict dataset itself is licensed CC0 1.0 Universal (public-domain
dedication) by its author, Soroush Vahidi, as published on its authoritative
public release:

    https://huggingface.co/datasets/SoroushVahidi/lafc-evict

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

No dataset rows, Parquet files, or other data payloads are stored in this
repository. This repository contains only a tutorial notebook and
documentation that describe how to access and use the dataset.

2. Tutorial materials in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------

The tutorial notebook (`get-to-know-a-dataset.ipynb`) and this README are
original works authored by Soroush Vahidi. To match the dataset's own
licensing and to keep reuse simple, these materials are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Scholarly attribution is requested but not legally required — see the
citation entry in `README.md`.

3. Upstream third-party data (referenced, not redistributed)
--------------------------------------------------------------

LAFC-Evict is derived from Wikimedia's public pageview data, which is
licensed CC0 1.0 by the Wikimedia Foundation:

    https://dumps.wikimedia.org/other/pageviews/

This repository and the dataset it describes make no ownership claim over
the upstream Wikimedia data. No raw Wikimedia rows, page titles, or other
third-party trace data appear anywhere in this repository or in the
dataset it documents. Anyone using the upstream Wikimedia data directly
should cite Wikimedia and follow Wikimedia's own terms, independent of this
repository's or the dataset's licensing.
